      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berne%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early settlers were Palatine German refugees who arrived before 1750, during the colonial era.",
